      "title": "NZ",
      "formats": [
        "zarr-v3"
      ],
      "description": "NetCDF Zarr convention: the structural layer between Zarr v3 and domain conventions such as CF, as the NetCDF Users Guide is for netCDF (dimension names, the conventions attribute, _FillValue).",
